Package: tennisAbstract
Title: A Package to Recreate NYT Datavizs
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Charles", "Tao", , "charles_tao@berkeley.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Gets the career matches of a given player (e.g. Serena Williams, Rafael Nadal) from tennisabstract.com, and makes an unannotated plot like the New York Times's data visualization of Homework 2.
